    "note": "HAND-DERIVED, not captured. `done` is not a state an agent can be in — herdr derives it from (idle, seen = false) — so a pair of them tiled in one tab cannot be captured on demand. Trimmed to the fields this scenario exercises. Carries `layouts[]` for the two-pane tab, so the body pane index is derivable from geometry; `panes[]` stays empty, since nothing in this scenario reads it.",
